@Gateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@token = your_jwt_token_here

### Get User Orders
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Order by ID
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Create Order
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryAddress": "123 Main St, City, Country",
  "notes": "Please ring the doorbell",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
      "productName": "Delicious Pizza",
      "productImageUrl": "/images/pizza.jpg",
      "unitPrice": 12.99,
      "quantity": 2,
      "notes": "Extra cheese"
    },
    {
      "productId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa7",
      "productName": "Caesar Salad",
      "productImageUrl": "/images/salad.jpg",
      "unitPrice": 8.50,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

###

### Update Order Status (Admin)
PATCH {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Confirmed"
}

###

### Cancel Order
DELETE {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

